  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15cffd0c8ac1f726",
      "translationZh": "原生语音到语音模型的出现，为提升语音智能体的能力和简化支持语音的工作流程带来了令人兴奋的机遇。然而，评估这种简化是否以模型性能为代价，或是否引入了其他权衡，至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "deed5265c57e5caa",
      "translationZh": "为支持对此的分析，Artificial Analysis 正在发布 Big Bench Audio，这是一个用于评估音频语言模型推理能力的新评测数据集。该数据集将 Big Bench Hard 中的问题改编到音频领域；之所以选择 Big Bench Hard，是因为它能严格测试高级推理能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec4adcf7fd841bcc",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍 Big Bench Audio 数据集，以及 GPT-4o 和 Gemini 1.5 系列模型的初步基准测试结果。我们的分析考察了这些模型在多种模态下的表现：原生语音到语音、语音到文本、文本到语音以及文本到文本。我们在下文以及 Artificial Analysis 网站新上线的语音到语音页面上提供了结果概览。我们的初步结果显示出显著的“语音推理差距”：GPT-4o 在该数据集的纯文本版本上准确率达到 92%，但其语音到语音表现的准确率降至 66%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c0d90ce3927573c0",
      "translationZh": "Big Bench Audio 数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90a5a8a3011c3b4e",
      "translationZh": "Big Bench Audio 包含从 Big Bench Hard 的四个类别中选取的 1,000 道音频问题，选择这些类别的依据都是它们是否适合音频评测：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c64bb95efa2bc7da",
      "translationZh": "形式谬误：评估基于给定陈述进行逻辑演绎的能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72465e5980c64ac5",
      "translationZh": "导航：判断执行导航步骤后是否回到起点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6443bd547b74cff6",
      "translationZh": "物体计数：对集合中的特定物品进行计数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e2735298f1e7fe4",
      "translationZh": "谎言之网：评估以自然语言表达的布尔逻辑",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49fc736c3b7ade8b",
      "translationZh": "每个类别提供 250 个问题，从而构建一个均衡的数据集，并避开高度依赖视觉元素的任务，或包含在转化为口语时可能产生歧义的文本的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e49773249c61f301",
      "translationZh": "数据集中的每个问题都采用以下结构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66f788810bda913b",
      "translationZh": "这些音频文件使用了 Artificial Analysis Speech Arena 中排名靠前的 Text to Speech 模型所提供的 23 种合成语音生成。每次生成的音频都通过与转录文本计算 Levenshtein 距离进行严格验证，边缘情况则由人工审核。要进一步了解该数据集的创建过程，请查看数据集说明卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1467bdca699fdc18",
      "translationZh": "评估音频推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "370dde39929dd4a3",
      "translationZh": "为了评估音频对各个模型推理表现的影响，我们在 Big Bench Audio 上测试了四种不同配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be7af520dc4d9cee",
      "translationZh": "Speech to Speech：提供一个输入音频文件，模型生成一个包含答案的输出音频文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c311171e93a0d43",
      "translationZh": "Speech to Text：提供一个输入音频文件，模型生成文本答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ec3151c8fa337e5",
      "translationZh": "文本转语音：提供问题的文本版本，模型生成包含答案的音频输出文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0f8947026480772",
      "translationZh": "文本转文本：提供问题的文本版本，模型生成文本答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62a0e6111929026a",
      "translationZh": "基于这些配置，我们进行了十八项实验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2d6ce2e8ecc208c",
      "translationZh": "模型 语音转语音 语音转文本 文本转语音 文本转文本 GPT-4o Realtime Preview（'24 年 10 月） ✅ ✅ GPT-4o Realtime Preview（'24 年 12 月） ✅ GPT-4o mini Realtime Preview（'24 年 12 月） ✅ GPT-4o ChatCompletions Audio Preview ✅ ✅ 语音转语音流水线（whisper, GPT-4o, tts-1）1 ✅ GPT-4o（'24 年 8 月） ✅ Gemini 1.5 Flash（‘24 年 5 月） ✅ ✅ Gemini 1.5 Flash（‘24 年 9 月） ✅ ✅ Gemini 1.5 Pro（‘24 年 5 月） ✅ ✅ Gemini 1.5 Pro（‘24 年 9 月） ✅ ✅ Gemini 2.0 Flash（实验版） ✅ ✅（表 1 - 实验配置）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da4f7ea58d963b1a",
      "translationZh": "注：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c11b4492a7f6599",
      "translationZh": "使用 OpenAI 的 Whisper 对输入音频文件进行转写。随后将转写文本输入 GPT-4o，以生成答案。再使用 OpenAI 的 TTS-1 模型将该答案转换为音频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7d750461806092b",
      "translationZh": "评估方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66459bf985ce3255",
      "translationZh": "为确保对所有配置的评估保持一致且可扩展，我们开发了一套使用 LLM 评估器的自动评估系统。其工作原理如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62621f410fd784be",
      "translationZh": "对于音频回答，我们首先使用 OpenAI 的 Whisper API 将其转录为文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65942753a6122b36",
      "translationZh": "对于文本回答，我们直接将其用作“候选答案”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b09b94918d3249f9",
      "translationZh": "LLM 评估器接收以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b36d23595f81808b",
      "translationZh": "候选答案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "669f9e5a217ea809",
      "translationZh": "官方答案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db7f793ff665cb67",
      "translationZh": "原始问题（用于提供上下文）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c08202b390f30f0f",
      "translationZh": "我们向 LLM 评估器提供候选答案、官方答案和原始问题作为上下文，并通过提示要求其将候选答案标记为正确或错误。对于 Artificial Analysis 上列出的 Big Bench Audio 分数，我们使用 Anthropic 的 Claude 3.5 Sonnet（2024 年 10 月版）作为 LLM 评估器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c91aa319aa2bdc28",
      "translationZh": "LLM 评估器提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
